#: ../../source/products/index.rst:7
msgid ""
"快速确定 **定位能力、产品形态和差分链路**。需要核对完整规格时进入“产品对比与"
"资料”；已经收到设备时，可直接进入相应用户手册。"
msgstr ""
"Use this page to choose the **positioning capability, form factor, and "
"correction link**. Open Product Comparison and Resources for complete "
"specifications, or go directly to the corresponding user guide when the "
"device is ready for setup."

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:10
msgid "产品矩阵概览"
msgstr "Product Matrix Overview"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"定位产品分为 RTK 和 GNSS 两个系列。RTK 是当前主系列，包括轻量化四臂螺旋一体"
"化 D20 和紧凑型一体化 D13； 两个系列均提供 4G 和 LoRa 差分链路。GNSS 系列当前"
"提供 HM-G51B。"
msgstr ""
"The portfolio includes RTK and GNSS products. The primary RTK range consists "
"of the lightweight D20 with a quadrifilar helix antenna (QHA) and the "
"compact all-in-one D13. Both offer 4G and LoRa correction links. The GNSS "
"range currently includes HM-G51B."

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:16
msgid "RTK 系列"
msgstr "RTK Series"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"RTK 产品将 GNSS 天线、定位计算单元和通信链路集成在完整设备中，通过标准接口直"
"接输出定位结果。 **D20** 适合对重量和空间敏感的无人机及移动平台；**D13** 适合"
"地面移动站和固定区域作业。 下表用于选择产品形态和差分链路。"
msgstr ""
"Each RTK receiver integrates the GNSS antenna, positioning engine, and "
"communication link, then outputs positioning results through a standard "
"interface. Choose **D20** for weight- and space-sensitive UAVs or mobile "
"platforms, and **D13** for ground rovers or fixed-area operations. Use the "
"matrix below to select the form factor and correction link."

