#: ../../source/products/index.rst:62
msgid "GNSS 系列"
msgstr "GNSS Series"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:64
msgid ""
"GNSS 系列目前以 HM-G51B 为代表，面向不需要 RTK 差分链路的独立 GNSS 定位和紧凑"
"型终端集成场景， 适用于资产追踪、车载导航、紧凑型终端和对成本、尺寸、集成复杂"
"度更敏感的应用。"
msgstr ""
"The GNSS family is represented by HM-G51B for standalone GNSS positioning "
"and compact-system integration without an RTK correction link. It suits "
"asset tracking, in-vehicle navigation, compact terminals, and applications "
"sensitive to cost, size, or integration complexity."

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:67
msgid ":doc:`查看 HM-G51B <models/hm-g51b>`"
msgstr ":doc:`View HM-G51B <models/hm-g51b>`"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:70
msgid "怎么选择"
msgstr "How to Choose"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:72
msgid "三步完成选择"
msgstr "Choose in three steps"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:75
msgid "**先看定位能力，再看安装形态，最后选择差分链路。**"
msgstr ""
"**Choose the positioning capability, then the form factor, and finally the "
"correction link.**"

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:77
msgid ""
"**先看定位能力**：需要厘米级定位时选择 RTK 系列；只需要独立单频 GNSS 定位时选"
"择 HM-G51B。"
msgstr ""
"**Positioning capability**: Choose the RTK series for centimeter-level "
"positioning, or HM-G51B for standalone single-band GNSS positioning."

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:78
msgid ""
"**再看安装形态**：对重量、空间和无人机集成更敏感时优先选择 D20；需要紧凑型封"
"装或稳定地面安装时选择 D13。"
msgstr ""
"**Form factor**: Choose D20 when weight, space, or UAV integration is "
"critical; choose D13 for a compact enclosure or stable ground installation."

#: ../../source/products/index.rst:79
msgid ""
"**最后选差分链路**：有稳定蜂窝网络和 CORS/NTRIP 服务时选择 4G；希望本地自建、"
"不依赖公网时选择 LoRa 套件。"
msgstr ""
"**Correction link**: Choose 4G where cellular coverage and a CORS/NTRIP "
"service are available; choose a LoRa kit for a local link independent of "
"public networks."

